# UTF-8 source encoding (no Windows-1252)

- All text source (`.cs`, `.xaml`, `.md`, `.json`, etc.) must be **UTF-8**.
- WPF XAML in this repo should match existing clean files (**UTF-8 with BOM** — `App.xaml` uses BOM).
- **Never** save or convert files as Windows-1252, Windows-125x, or “ANSI”.
- When editing XAML/CS with non-ASCII (—, …, ×, ≈), preserve UTF-8; do not introduce U+FFFD or mojibake.
- Prefer ASCII fallbacks (`...`, `x`, `-`) only if UTF-8 cannot be guaranteed.
